# SCENARIO: p5_cam_hold_lagmark   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: auto   BOTCFG: auto
# P5 (#160) V7: the bot-camera observer contract. An @cast operator camera rides a bot near the
# Thais temple; the player then logs OUT, so the camera is the ONLY observer. Over a 10-minute hold
# the watched bot must never hibernate (getCastViewerCount guard), and the census `cast` field must
# count the one camera. /lagmark x30 (no rate limit on the bot camera channel) gives the RTT.
@srv audit kinds hib,wake,census,cmd
@srv audit watch *
@srv audit on expect="enabled=on"
@p1 login
@p1 goto 32367,32240,7 range=2 stuck=10
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=180 as=BOT
@cam:$BOT login
@cam:$BOT lagmark 30
@p1 logout
@srv audit mark hold start
@cam:$BOT hold 600
@srv audit mark hold end
@cam:$BOT self
@srv expect-none src=srv:audit k=hib bot=$BOT within=615
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=census cast=1 min=3 within=600
@cam:$BOT logout
@srv audit off
